WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.212
&gt;&gt; Bret: OUR TOP STORY AT THE

00:00:12.544 --> 00:00:15.681
BOTTOM OF THE HOUR, THE ACCUSED

00:00:14.346 --> 00:00:17.215
SHOOTER IN YESTERDAY'S FLORIDA

00:00:15.814 --> 00:00:19.851
SCHOOL MASSACRE MADE HIS FIRST

00:00:17.349 --> 00:00:21.353
COURT APPEARANCE THIS AFTERNOON.

00:00:19.985 --> 00:00:23.021
19-YEAR-OLD NIKOLAUS CRUZ IS

00:00:21.486 --> 00:00:23.922
CHARGED WITH 17 COUNTS OF

00:00:23.155 --> 00:00:25.490
PREMEDITATED MURDER.

00:00:24.056 --> 00:00:27.960
MANY OF THOSE WHO SURVIVED ARE

00:00:25.624 --> 00:00:28.427
BEING TREATED AT A HOSPITAL IN

00:00:28.093 --> 00:00:31.496
POMPANO BEACH.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:32.397
THAT'S WHERE WE FIND CHIEF

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:33.265
NATIONAL CORRESPONDENT ED HENRY

00:00:32.531 --> 00:00:34.566
WITH THE LATEST.

00:00:33.398 --> 00:00:35.901
GOOD EVENING, ED.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.970
&gt;&gt; Reporter: BRET, GOOD EVENING.

00:00:36.034 --> 00:00:39.838
IF THERE'S EVEN A TINY BIT OF

00:00:38.103 --> 00:00:41.406
GOOD NEWS TONIGHT AMID ALL THIS

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:43.909
TRAGEDY, IT'S THAT THERE'S ONLY

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:45.444
ONE PATIENT LEFT IN CRITICAL

00:00:44.042 --> 00:00:47.246
CONDITION TONIGHT, AND THAT IS

00:00:45.577 --> 00:00:50.716
REALLY A MIRACLE, GIVEN THE

00:00:47.379 --> 00:00:53.652
TRIAGE THAT WENT ON BEHIND ME.

00:00:50.849 --> 00:00:56.288
AS THE HORROR BEGAN PLAYING OUT

00:00:53.786 --> 00:00:57.289
AT STONEMAN DOUGLAS HIGH SCHOOL,

00:00:56.422 --> 00:01:01.994
THE DOCTORS AT THE HOSPITAL

00:00:57.423 --> 00:01:04.597
INITIATED A CODE GREEN.

00:01:02.127 --> 00:01:06.131
ALL HANDS ON DESK DISASTER

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:08.067
ANNOUNCEMENT THEY TRAINED FOR

00:01:06.265 --> 00:01:09.769
JUST SIX MONTHS AGO, YET NOTHING

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:11.370
FULLY PREPARED THEM FOR THIS.

00:01:09.902 --> 00:01:12.872
&gt;&gt; WE KEPT ON GETTING PHONE

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:13.506
CALLS, ARE YOU READY TO RECEIVE

00:01:13.005 --> 00:01:15.074
MORE PATIENTS?

00:01:15.207 --> 00:01:19.311
ARE YOU READY TO TAKE THAT ONE?

00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:20.446
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THE DOCTORS HERE

00:01:19.445 --> 00:01:21.847
BELIEVE THERE WOULD HAVE BEEN

00:01:20.579 --> 00:01:24.216
FAR MORE DEATHS BUT FOR THE

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:25.284
REMARKABLE WORK OF THE EMERGENCY

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:27.119
PERSONNEL WHO STOPPED THE

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:28.921
BLEEDING ON SO MANY WOUNDS.

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:30.489
&gt;&gt; A COUPLE MINUTES I SAID, WOW,

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:31.590
THIS IS ACTUALLY HAPPENING.

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:32.692
THIS IS REAL LIFE.

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:34.093
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THERE WAS ALSO THE

00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:35.995
BRAVERY OF ONE OF THE FIRST

00:01:34.226 --> 00:01:38.965
VICTIMS WHO WAS IDENTIFIED,

00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:40.400
AARON FEISS, ASSISTANT FOOTBALL

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:41.868
COACH AND SECURITY GUARD WHO

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:43.269
USED HIS OWN BODY AS A HUMAN

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:48.941
FROM BEING SHOT.

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:51.144
&gt;&gt; WE HAD AN ATHLETIC DIRECTOR,

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:51.911
CAMPUS MONITOR, WHO RESPONDED

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:55.081
IMMEDIATELY WHEN THERE WAS SIGNS

00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:56.182
OF TROUBLE IN THE SCHOOL.

00:01:55.214 --> 00:01:58.051
UNFORTUNATELY THOSE TWO HEROES

00:01:56.316 --> 00:01:59.118
GAVE THEIR LIVES FOR OUR KIDS

00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:02.689
AND PROBABLY HELPED PREVENT THIS

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:03.022
FROM BEING A WORSE TRAGEDY

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:03.690
TODAY.

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:05.058
&gt;&gt; Reporter: STUDENTS WHO

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:07.126
SURVIVED THE BLOODSHED GIVE

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:08.594
GREAT CREDIT TO A JANITOR WHO

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:09.696
SAVED DOZENS OF LIVES BY

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:11.197
REALIZING WHEN THE SHOOTER

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:12.799
PULLED A FIRE ALARM, A LARGE

00:02:11.331 --> 00:02:14.267
GROUP OF BARRICADED STUDENTS

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:16.669
WERE HEADED RIGHT AT HIM.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:18.504
&gt;&gt; AS A RESULT OF THEIR HEROIC

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:20.606
ACTION, THEY SAVED PROBABLY ALL

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:21.474
OF OUR LIVES, ABOUT 40 OF US.

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:23.276
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THE 19-YEAR-OLD

00:02:21.607 --> 00:02:25.244
SHOOTER WAS ORDERED HELD WITHOUT

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:27.613
BOND, AFTER A BRIEF HEARING.

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:28.815
&gt;&gt; ARE YOU NIKOLAUS JACOB CRUZ?

00:02:27.747 --> 00:02:29.582
&gt;&gt; YES, MA'AM.

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:31.751
&gt;&gt; OKAY, SIR.

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:33.886
YOU ARE CHARGED WITH 17 COUNTS

00:02:31.884 --> 00:02:34.887
OF PREMEDITATED MURDER.

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:36.489
&gt;&gt; Reporter: MEANWHILE, PEOPLE

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:38.024
IN THIS SHATTERED FLORIDA

00:02:36.622 --> 00:02:40.326
COMMUNITY TRIED TO COME TOGETHER

00:02:38.157 --> 00:02:42.562
WITH AN AFTERNOON VIGIL, TO TRY

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:45.198
TO HELP EASE THE PAIN OF SO

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:46.666
MANY, LIKE THIS GIRL WHOSE BEST

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:46.933
FRIEND WAS SHOT RIGHT NEXT TO

00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:47.667
HER.

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:50.503
&gt;&gt; UNFORTUNATELY SHE DIDN'T MAKE

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:52.638
IT.

00:02:50.636 --> 00:02:54.607
&gt;&gt; Reporter: NOW, WE SHOULD NOTE

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:56.709
THIS IS ONE OF TWO HOSPITALS IN

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:57.143
THE BROWARD HEALTH SYSTEM THAT

00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:59.045
HELPED OUT.

00:02:57.276 --> 00:03:00.213
ALL TOLD, WHEN YOU COMBINE BOTH

00:02:59.178 --> 00:03:02.115
HOSPITALS, THERE'S THAT ONE

00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:02.548
PATIENT I MENTIONED IN CRITICAL

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:04.350
CONDITION.

00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:06.219
THERE'S NOW SEVEN PATIENTS IN

00:03:04.484 --> 00:03:07.053
FAIR CONDITION, AND ONE TONIGHT

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:09.489
IN GOOD CONDITION.

